{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"738969785999687772","content":"\"Know whatcha mean.\" His fingers kinda twitch.","created_at":"2020-08-03T00:38:22.812000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739643292383313990","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"738969785999687772","content":"\"It's this weird feeling I get sometimes, maybe you feel it too. It's hard to describe but...\" She thinks for a moment, \"it's like how as soon as we got here, everyone knew what to do. They started building houses and running business. Going to pubs and throwing parties... Like it was completely normal for them.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T00:41:41.946000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-03T00:45:53.981000Z","id":"739644127611715635","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"738969785999687772","content":"\"Yes! Exactly! Im tryina just help whoever asks n stay busy so I don't have t think about it.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T00:45:55.963000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-03T00:46:03.423000Z","id":"739645193036365864","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"738969785999687772","content":"\"I feel like I dont belong even though no one's said anything to make me feel that way.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T00:46:27.952000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739645327207825439","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"738969785999687772","content":"\"I felt like I was t only one.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T00:46:45.757000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739645401887539201","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"738969785999687772","content":"She smiles a bit hearing this. \"No Skitter, you're not the only one! I feel like that all the time! I can't even go inside without feeling weird... Out of place. Like the Masons have a big fancy mansion and I took a peek inside and I could just *feel* it. All those fancy shiney things...\" She shivers. \"And I love Daysong! I want to go in! It just can't get myself to do it!\" She looks excited to have someone to talk to about this with.","created_at":"2020-08-03T00:53:56.845000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-03T00:54:36.324000Z","id":"739647210001793174","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
