{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"738969785999687772","content":"♪  catches up! He’s as bad as always at hiding his emotions, and it looks like whatever he did didn’t go great.","created_at":"2020-08-03T01:01:37.699000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739649142963437622","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"738969785999687772","content":"Leaf continues nodding, \"I'm always scared people are going to think I steal things. I mean, I don't think anyone here would be like that, but it's always just in the back of my mind. Plus,\" her hands go to her dress, \"technically I stole this. I didn't know how to buy it, and I thought that having it would help me in the city. But it sounds so dumb, to say I didn't know how to use money, but I didn't!\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T01:02:39.093000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739649400468537406","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"738969785999687772","content":"He nods to note. \"I knew how t use money and I still stole. Whered you tink I got any of me things from?\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T01:04:52.794000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739649961251307562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"738969785999687772","content":"\"You're more than how you survived.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T01:05:18.926000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-03T01:05:32.754000Z","id":"739650070856597515","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"738969785999687772","content":"\"People don't get it nless they been der.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T01:05:58.749000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739650237886496902","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"738969785999687772","content":"\"And most people never will. It's not like I wish more people to go through that kind of thing, but it's nice to have people who get it.\" She thinks for a moment. \"Part of me thought that people would point things out more... Like how I look and things, but they didn't. I was really happy they didn't say anything, and everyone here has been so nice. But sometimes I just wonder what they think, you know? About me being a goblin...\" She stretches out her green, slightly clawed hands in front of her like she's examining them.","created_at":"2020-08-03T01:14:32.009000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739652390655098902","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
